      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COSMIC REWARD (5) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at Shepparton in a handy 22.42 beating Ivory Quill. The form from his last run stacks up well. Hard to go past. PAW SAUNDRA (7) is having her first look at this course. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 2.5 lengths (22.56) at Warrnambool. Deserves plenty of respect. GOOSEBUMPS RICO (8) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 5.5 lengths into third (25.93) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 450m. Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and two minor placings from 10 starts. Leading chance. ULTIMO (4) showed great speed to lead all the way last start. Will give a great sight.",
